const PROFILE_FIELDS={name:'outputProfileName',format:'profileFormat',fps:'profileFps',videoBitrateKbps:'profileVideoBitrate',codec:'profileCodec',keyframeSeconds:'profileKeyframe',audioBitrateKbps:'profileAudioBitrate',twitchVod:'profileTwitchVod'};
const AUDIO_CATEGORIES={voice:'Guest microphones',screen:'Guest screen audio',video:'Video audio',program:'Other Program audio',soundboard:'Soundboard audio',graphics:'Graphics audio',audience:'Audience alerts'};
